== the stack, bottom layer first
hardware_io  : motor_mcu_fw(cpu9,high)
drivers      : imu_driver(cpu1,high) motor_bridge(cpu1,high) camera_driver(cpu1) lidar_driver(cpu2)
middleware   : dds_middleware(cpu2)
estimation   : state_estimator(cpu1,high)
control      : controller(cpu1,high)
perception   : detector(cpu1)
planning     : planner(cpu3)
operations   : logger(cpu2) health_monitor(cpu1,high)
== CPU budgets
cpu1: 7 components, U = 1.160, RM bound 0.729 -> OVERLOADED: no scheduler can meet every deadline
